# ===========================================
# DOCKERIGNORE - Excluir arquivos do build
# ===========================================

# Node modules (serão instalados no container)
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/out/

# OneDrive
**/.onedriveignore
**/.onedrive/

# Git
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.test
.env*.local

# Logs
*.log
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Uploads locais (em produção usa R2)
**/uploads/
backend/uploads/

# Certificados SSL (não devem ir para produção)
certificates/
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.cert

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS files
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Build outputs
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo/

# Test files
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/

# Documentation (opcional - remover se quiser incluir)
**/*.md
!README.md

# Cache
**/.cache/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.tmp/
**/tmp/
**/temp/

# Backups
**/backups/

# Scripts de desenvolvimento
**/scripts/
!**/scripts/*.sh

# TypeScript build info
**/*.d.ts.map
**/*.js.map

